                "objectiveId": "classified-objectives",
                "status": "needs-verification",
                "description": "ITS 17 V0.2 EN p. 55 explicitly gives 2 Objective Points per Classified Objective for two Objectives. ES p. 50 instead states two Classified Objectives and '2 Puntos de Objetivo' without 'each'. Preserve this language-scope ambiguity; follow the explicit English scoring."
              },
              {
                "id": "activation-first-round-bilingual",
                "armyPoints": [
                  150,
                  200,
                  250,
                  300,
                  350,
                  400
                ],
                "objectiveId": "extracted-civilians",
                "status": "needs-verification",
                "description": "ITS 17 V0.2 EN p. 57 prohibits Activate Extraction Console in the first Game Round; ES p. 52 uses 'primer Turno de Juego' (first Game Turn), not the usual Spanish term for Game Round. Preserve the unresolved timing distinction."
              },
              {
